    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/6bd6bb8502729eb2d3bf02c4a60d8a19.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items, level up, roll for better loot and freeze items for later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting 3 of a single item upgrades them into a triple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/19462ed716477cbd45f13f207928e858.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your items do the fighting!<br>Some items scale permanently during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/81a5fd96f2d907932472b2e4d54aeb96.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get highly synergistic combos that scale exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Async PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly synergistic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you can buy new items in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to earn higher rarity items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ different items and more to come.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/6bd6bb8502729eb2d3bf02c4a60d8a19.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/26a1e417c5b3fd83eee008f8e63f4864.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items, level up, roll for better loot and freeze items for later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting 3 of a single item upgrades them into a triple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/19462ed716477cbd45f13f207928e858.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/f02e09403df0db99a9f7df809a0f1a09.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your items do the fighting!<br>Some items scale permanently during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/81a5fd96f2d907932472b2e4d54aeb96.avif?t=1749732471\" width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.poster.avif?t=1749732471\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.webm?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/566c65f35d3b80f1bbc7aea32eca7924.mp4?t=1749732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get highly synergistic combos that scale exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Async PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly synergistic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you can buy new items in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to earn higher rarity items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ different items and more to come.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
